xtras/60ea754960809237814e972beecfb787.mp4?t=1754587923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, cozy and positive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying gameplay with no time limits or game overs, but with multiple solutions and outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling \u2013 piece together a heartfelt and emotional story about life in a new country.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute dioramas, filled with hundreds of interesting items waiting to be cleaned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of interactive elements to engage with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your personal cozy space in a rented apartment, arranged using items found while cleaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive and accessible controls.</p></li></ul>",
